<title>USA: F.N.B. Q3 net falls after SAIF assessment.</title>
<headline>F.N.B. Q3 net falls after SAIF assessment.</headline>
<dateline>HERMITAGE, Pa. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.36		    $0.51</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.35		    $0.49</p>
<p> Net			  3,503		    4,856</p>
<p>			9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.40		    $1.38</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$1.34		    $1.33</p>
<p> Net			 13,446		   13,185</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 and nine months include Savings Association Insurance Fund assessment, which lowered primary EPS by $0.21 per share and lowered diluted EPS by $0.19 per share.</p>
<p>Before the SAIF assessment, Q3 EPS was $0.57 vs $0.51 on primary basis and $0.54 vs $0.49 on diluted basis. Nine month EPS was $1.61 vs $1.38 on primary basis and $1.53 vs $1.33 on diluted basis, before the SAIF assessment.</p>
</text>
